{
  "name": "dsh-tool-guard",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Shell 纪律硬防线：用 harness 原生单调守卫（tools/pre-execute 机制层）把可静态判定的 shell 安全纪律变成硬拒绝 —— 递归强删、绕过 wrapper、pkill -f 自匹配、宿主重启连带回收本次调用内的进程与 job 等；拒绝理由作为工具错误回灌模型，引导改做而不是绕过。带 enabled 开关与 allowPatterns 豁免逃生口。",
  "main": "index.js",
  "type": "module",
  "license": "MIT",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "README.md",
    "cordis.patch.yml"
  ],
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.4",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-tools": "0.2.0-rc.2",
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "3.18.4"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "guard",
    "safety",
    "denylist",
    "pre-execute",
    "tool-guard",
    "shell",
    "destructive-commands"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  }
}
